  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core and Flexible Funding to Women&apos;s Rights Organisations and Women&apos;s Networks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s aim is to enable locally-rooted women peacebuilders (WPBs) and women&apos;s rights organisations to participate and contribute their know-how more effectively to mitigate crises and improve peace, security, and reconciliation processes, with particular attention to engaging security sector actors, and through cross-country lessons sharing and community-based programs.  The project funds activity in ODA eligible countries including: Iraq, Yemen, East Africa, Syria, and Myanmar.  The welfare and economic development of these countries will improve as a result of this project.</narrative>
  </description>
